# Burnout Revenge (45410076), Nova, FIRST RUN: no Burnout Revenge profile on
# the disk. DRAFT by lane.routeprep, 2026-09-26, not played.
#
# Evidence: pass 1 (0-0-y-1790433159-titleplay-p1-burnout-rev, Nova), frames
# in its route-frames/ (t = seconds after the route started):
#   075152 t42 and 075213 t63: the attract FMV (split-screen crash replays)
#   075221 title "Press START to continue" (after the START at t63)
#   075232 SAVE/LOAD: "Burnout Revenge needs a profile to store your
#          progression. Would you like to create or load a profile?"
#          Load Profile (highlighted) above Create Profile
#   075238 A on Load Profile: "There are no profiles to load", OK -> back to
#          the prompt. Pass 1 went round this loop for the whole run.
#
# The fix: one flick down to Create Profile, then A. Nothing past that has
# been seen. The rest leans on Burnout 3 (same studio, same profile flow),
# whose played routes (routes/burnout3.*.route) show: a name keyboard with a
# default name and `Done` highlighted (A), then "save your profile? YES / NO"
# with NO highlighted (flick UP, then A), then the main menu, WORLD TOUR first.
# In Burnout 3 a RACE TRAINING video of ~110 s that neither A nor START
# skipped played before the first race; Revenge may have the same.
wait 55
shot boot55
wait 8
mark booted
press START                 # [seen t63->075221] attract -> title
wait 6
shot title
press START                 # [seen 075226->075232] title -> SAVE/LOAD prompt
wait 6
shot saveload               # expect Load Profile highlighted [seen 075232]
axis LY max                 # [inferred] down: Create Profile
wait 0.15
axis LY mid
wait 0.6
shot on-create              # CHECK: Create Profile highlighted
press A                     # [inferred] Create Profile
wait 6
shot keyboard               # [guess, Burnout 3] name keyboard, default name, Done highlighted
press A                     # [guess, Burnout 3] Done
wait 6
shot save-prompt            # [guess, Burnout 3] "save your profile? YES / NO", NO highlighted
axis LY min                 # [guess, Burnout 3] up: YES
wait 0.15
axis LY mid
wait 0.6
shot save-yes
press A
wait 10
shot saved                  # OPEN: a storage-device choice or "saving" notice may show; A is next either way
mark profile-saved
press A
wait 6
shot main-menu              # [guess] WORLD TOUR first, as in Burnout 3
press A                     # World Tour
wait 6
shot tour
press A                     # [guess] first event
wait 6
shot event
press A                     # [guess] car / confirm
wait 6
shot car
press A
wait 30
shot loading
wait 90                     # [guess, Burnout 3] a race-training video that ignores A and START
shot pre-race
wait 20
shot grid
mark gameplay               # [guess] placeholder: move to the first frame of the race with the HUD
repeat forever {
    axis RT max
    axis LX min
    wait 1.5
    axis LX max
    wait 1.5
    axis LX mid
    wait 3
}
